+/*
+** Figure out if we are dealing with Unix, Windows, or some other operating
+** system.
+**
+** After the following block of preprocess macros, all of
+**
+**    SQLITE_OS_KV
+**    SQLITE_OS_OTHER
+**    SQLITE_OS_UNIX
+**    SQLITE_OS_WIN
